Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a winter fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make it my dream come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.\NShine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is all that fluttering wearing you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't take it, why don't\Nyou try groveling, toy soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That confirms it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:03:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All those years ago, that toy soldier\Ncrying like a baby in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the mighty Kiros.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Scarlet's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And Rebecca's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, I imagine you've got quite a lot of\Nbad blood to settle with me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you found your footing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But my cape's made of steel. Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vyparaglase!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't want to miss your own funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I had such a lovely\Ntime killing your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to kill your daughter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my atonement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And for forcing you to\Nfight alone all those years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so ashamed for\Nputting you through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For failing to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my human form has returned,\NI want my daughter to live in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and never swing a sword again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lao-G is up for the count!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some real power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've heard of these guys before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hapa Sui army from Kano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can become an enemy at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gramps!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die! Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll reserve two event venues\Nfor us real soon, okay, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Venues? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One for our wedding, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, Gladius!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to die crawling on\Nthe ground like a beast, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This should shut you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladius!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's turned the whole area into a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been plotting this\Nfor ages now, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.34,0:06:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bartolomeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in the area is about to blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me inside your barrier, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If I open it, that'll put\Nme and Miss Robin in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, enemies might sneak in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm your ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just leave\Nme to die, gladius sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna blow us up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're professionals after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:06:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pop rock fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Cavendish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd been stuck out there, that\Nwould've wiped you out for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So why'd you wait until the last second?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I could've died!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that any way to act towards\Nsomeone who just saved your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been out there\Nfighting all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my thank you? Bite me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to win! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:08:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream at me and beg to come\Nin and now you want out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.34,0:08:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't stick around for five\Nminutes just to be polite?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your house!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fighting a battle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for offense!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you in next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm about to die, you'd better!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to win this fight or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll settle this later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, Miss Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, she's doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon, Rebecca. Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You cunning little tramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You've caused the\Nexecutives enough trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Catapult Pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Variability!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.36,0:08:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Back it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd blown him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it to the bank, Miss Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Rooster, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She just winked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She was totally like,\Nthanks, little rooster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be my slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even step on you\Nif you behave, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta check yourself, Bato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep that one in the realm of fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, dude, this is good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hyped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Cavendish?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're behind the barrier, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, Gladius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Blade of Beauty! Brachio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladius, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bottle of mayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrier balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It protects him when\Nit's crushing all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Miss Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All it takes is one little wink, and\Nmy heart lights up like an inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Bartolomeo, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna crush your ally!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Cabbage, but there's a\Ngood reason why I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.56,0:10:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm feeling super jazzed, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm high as a kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't stop this train!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,WE 'LL HIT THE EMERGENCY BREAK, MORON!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,NO CAN DO!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dellinger! Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you cleaned up\Nthe second level yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gladius!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Going for a jog?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll join you in a sec, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, but make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin is climbing to the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't stop her because my\Nhands are full with these two idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha! That's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to join the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said ignore me at your own peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.86,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how to\Ntake a hint, do you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Longarm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've been hiding your extra joints\Nin those weird shoulder thingies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of creepy, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're a champion fighter, but\Nyou've got a hole in your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just drop dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a man's world, and that\Nmeans I'm bound by a sense of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To all those brave fighters\Nwho fell before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How noble of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd played dead, I\Nmight have spared your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the point of standing up now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:11:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still buy time at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep\Nyou busy until Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounce the tar out of Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So beat me if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But the only victory that matters.\NI'll win with my allies as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead of calling it defeat,\Nyou call it a noble sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Spoken like a true loser, sense\Nof duty is a shackle for the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no ordinary human, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The strength of a fighting fish\Ncourses through every muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here, Gladius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You still need my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladius, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dellinger, go back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a deadly enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I've seen the competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and if we team up, there's\Nnobody that can beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dillinger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dillinger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That little creep with the horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the soldiers totally ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One dude did all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's freaky as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is up with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dressed like cabbage,\Nbut that can't be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Something just like this happened back\Nat the Coliseum during the D-Block fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm speechless, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that, the\Nwhole ring is out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He cleared out those gladiators\Nin the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.86,0:15:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The clothes, the hair,\Nthe sword, all Cavendish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But that face is somebody else's dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So what kind of dish are\Nwe dealing with here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too fast to even see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, this guy's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, creepy face, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.76,0:16:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can zip around as fast as you\Nlike, but you're not getting in,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,even if you ask nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to kill me for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're mad about me kicking\Nyou out earlier, get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you looking at\Nup there, you big weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get any funny ideas, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.28,0:16:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You come back here and fight me! Leave Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite a wicked look on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor cabbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't have time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca needs me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, she stopped him! What a move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This Robin is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I thinkin',
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,sayin' I would protect you when I so\Nclearly pale before your brilliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Akubar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't give you permission to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot come out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for attacking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard word of your deadly alter ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakuba, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's quite the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He goes after anyone he sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll take your arms and\Nlegs, then I'll chop your whole
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,body into tiny pieces niko\Nrobin no one can escape my blade
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,would you go away now is not the time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up. Why don't you\Ngo back to sleep? You
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,don't understand the\Nimportance of this fight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.02,0:18:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,i have a personal debt\Nto repay i'll turn this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.26,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,place into a sea of\Nblood this battle is my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,responsibility i don't\Ncare i'll rip this woman
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to shreds he must have a\Nsplit personality unless
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,this is just how he makes\Ndecisions my body my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuba, this fight is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.08,0:19:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's half cabbage and half psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This body belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You was half and half just a second ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I think he's\Ngone now. Please, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you release me from your grip?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,After what I just saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fine, right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take my revenge\Non both of you at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you try to fly away, you can't\Nescape the blast radius of the entire wall
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.16,0:20:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll survive up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to abandon the plan\Nfor now, let's get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, and the time that takes,\NRebecca could be badly hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep your damn explosions\Naway from Miss Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a surprisingly sound judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you defeat me, it will\Nindeed cancel the rupture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pop hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all numb. What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those hairs are poison needles. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:20:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.52,0:21:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the power of the pop-pop fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From head to toe, I am a rupture man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do harm to me, my\Nwhole body will burst,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and thousands of those poison\Nneedles that handily thwarted you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,will pierce your two friends up above.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you don't harm\Nme, the wall will explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, which shall it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind that the explosion of\Nmy body will kill you as well. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,not worried about me getting wrecked\Nbut it seems like miss Robin gets
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,hurt either way well look at you\Nsuch a fast learner come on don't let
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,him get under your skin keep your\Neyes on the prize Bato what's your
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,priority right now that's obvious
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.84,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta protect miss Robert if I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:22:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to stop the explosion, I gotta\Nbust stop this fat-ass hedgehog dude
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but then there's the poison needle\Nthing which will hurt robin as well
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,i gotta think outside the box here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.36,0:22:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,come on brain think no think harder
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.16,0:22:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,wait a sec what if there's some way i\Ncould sacrifice cabbage to save miss robin
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,i got an idea cabbage i'm gonna beat up\Nthe hedgehog guy to stop the explosion
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then when the poison things shoot out,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you act as a human shield and make\Nsure none of them hit Miss Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.20,0:22:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot. Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Roaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cabbage got all evil again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.44,0:22:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We got an emergency here and he\Ncan't keep his head on straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Robin's in danger\Nfrom Bad Cabbage, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a plan right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You decided to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only put up one barrier\Nat a time, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.14,0:23:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I need to pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as I can save Miss Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't think twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I got. No regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.30,0:23:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Perrier ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can blow a ball you like, fatso!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's getting past that barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Krister, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.18,0:23:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.94,0:23:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Going to sacrifice yourself,\Nare you? Fine then!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.74,0:24:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fashion Pup!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Booster, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.86,0:24:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on that, you stupid hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I shut you down and I\Nshut down your wall bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.24,0:24:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved Miss Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What more could I ever ask for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.30,0:24:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but your aim needs work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.86,0:24:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You missed by just a few centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.74,0:24:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, it was my shoulder\Nyou stabbed, not my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.58,0:24:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.49,0:24:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.34,0:24:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he was so big and round,\NI couldn't tell what was what!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.14,0:24:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.58,0:24:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a power holder as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.28,0:24:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.96,0:25:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm conscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.96,0:25:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the effects of my ability persist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.72,0:25:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now since you can't move, you can sit\Nthere and watch your friends explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.60,0:25:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I screw this up so bad? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.98,0:25:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.54,0:25:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for that lapse just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.66,0:25:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Cavendish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought Haki under control again,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have allowed him to\Nborrow half of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let go of me, so that I can kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.06,0:25:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use Hakuba's speed to help\Nyou escape to the Sunflower Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.02,0:25:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'll all explode\Nwhen the bomb goes off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other option left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.52,0:25:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.76,0:25:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.08,0:25:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.44,0:25:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to think!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.92,0:25:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.70,0:25:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.08,0:25:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You bested!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.18,0:25:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pop Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.12,0:26:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Arena!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.14,0:26:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Robbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.48,0:26:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your barrier was useful after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, both of them gone without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.64,0:26:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hurting your own body!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm willing to take things this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.14,0:26:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe you should listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sien Fleur!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.08,0:26:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider-Man, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.90,0:26:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.92,0:27:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hand stopped Hakuba's sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.64,0:27:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a complicated man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.56,0:27:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.54,0:27:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they escape\Nfrom a rupture that size?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.80,0:27:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be ashamed of myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.66,0:27:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking that I was good enough\Nto stand beside his loofiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.70,0:27:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Homage, holy fest!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.76,0:27:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.20,0:27:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I've still got a long way to go,\Nbut I swear I'll get stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.04,0:27:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrier, barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.54,0:27:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, when I'm strong enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.56,0:27:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe someday I'll be a man\Nwho's worthy of helping you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.56,0:27:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,PISTOL!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.70,0:28:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Had to borrow a little of\Nyour strength there, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.42,0:28:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.40,0:28:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.66,0:28:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never teaming up with cabbage\Nagain, that dude's annoying as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're having\Na real party down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.98,0:28:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.52,0:28:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like all this rocking and rolling\Nis too much even for seasoned gladiators.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.04,0:28:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.66,0:28:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, you can't block that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.74,0:28:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Swift pedals to sway his blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.22,0:28:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mille Fleur, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.98,0:28:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Butterfly! Mark it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.44,0:29:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.88,0:29:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.16,0:29:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Robiland!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.38,0:29:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You finished your mission, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.74,0:29:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.48,0:29:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to lend you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.74,0:29:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.65,0:29:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.68,0:29:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
